        assign etapes_en = 'One area per session~The one that just did the work. Stacking five areas blows up the total duration, and consistency collapses by the following week.|Bare skin~Fabric absorbs and scatters. A session run through leggings no longer delivers the stated dose, whatever the device.|Ten to twenty minutes~Twenty for a large area, ten for a joint. The device timer is enough: doubling the session does not double the result.|Three to five times a week~On the same area, several weeks running. Consistency is what the studies measure, not the isolated session.'

        assign erreurs_fr = 'Choisir l&apos;appareil avant la zone. Un grand panneau pour un seul genou co&ucirc;te de la place et du temps de mise en route, et c&apos;est le temps de mise en route qui d&eacute;cide de la r&eacute;gularit&eacute;.|Prendre la sensation de chaleur pour une mesure. Le proche infrarouge chauffe l&eacute;g&egrave;rement &agrave; courte distance&nbsp;; la chaleur n&apos;indique ni la dose ni la profondeur atteinte.|Changer de zone tous les jours pour « tout couvrir ». Trois s&eacute;ances par semaine sur une zone valent mieux que sept zones une fois chacune.|Juger au bout de dix jours. Sur la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration, ce qui se mesure se mesure sur des semaines de s&eacute;ances tenues.'
        assign erreurs_en = 'Picking the device before the area. A large panel for a single knee costs floor space and set-up time &mdash; and set-up time is what decides consistency.|Reading the warmth as a measurement. Near-infrared warms slightly at close range; warmth indicates neither dose nor depth reached.|Switching areas daily to cover everything. Three sessions a week on one area beats seven areas once each.|Judging after ten days. On recovery, what gets measured is measured over weeks of sustained sessions.'

        assign limites_fr = 'Ce n&apos;est pas un traitement~Les appareils Antared sont des produits de bien-&ecirc;tre, sans marquage CE de dispositif m&eacute;dical. Ils ne diagnostiquent, ne traitent et ne gu&eacute;rissent aucune maladie.|Une douleur qui dure rel&egrave;ve d&apos;un m&eacute;decin~Une douleur qui persiste, qui r&eacute;veille la nuit ou qui limite un mouvement se montre &agrave; un professionnel de sant&eacute;, pas &agrave; une lampe.|Elle ne remplace ni le sommeil ni le repos~Ce sont les deux variables qui d&eacute;terminent la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration. Aucune s&eacute;ance de lumi&egrave;re ne les compense.|Elle ne promet aucun r&eacute;sultat individuel~Les travaux publi&eacute;s d&eacute;crivent des tendances mesur&eacute;es en laboratoire. Aucun n&apos;a port&eacute; sur un appareil Antared.'
        assign limites_en = 'This is not a treatment~Antared devices are wellness products, without medical-device CE marking. They do not diagnose, treat, or cure any disease.|Lasting pain is a doctor&apos;s business~Pain that persists, wakes you at night, or limits a movement goes to a health professional, not to a lamp.|It replaces neither sleep nor rest~Those are the two variables that decide recovery. No light session compensates for them.|It promises no individual outcome~The published work describes trends measured in a lab. None of it was run on an Antared device.'

